<title>UK: Brent date kept, offered at Aug +5 cts - trade.</title>
<headline>Brent date kept, offered at Aug +5 cts - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Brent cargo loading August 12-14 was kept early from the paper chains by U.S. refiner Koch, traders said.</p>
<p>The cargo was on offer at August Brent +5 cents, five cents higher than the last deal done on Friday.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
